Military - note

This entry includes miscellaneous military information of significance
not included elsewhere.

Military branches

This entry lists the service branches subordinate to defense ministries
or the equivalent (typically ground, naval, air, and marine forces).

Military expenditures - dollar figure

This entry gives spending on defense programs in US dollars for the
